\section{Related Work}

There has been extensive previous work done on NER in different domains. To cite only a few, for financial domain \citet{liu2012building}, for social media \citet{lample2016neural}, for biomedical domain \citet{lange2016cnn} and for biomedical domain \citet{mullenbach-etal-2018-explainable}. The list of papers here is not exhaustive, it merely represents the works that we found most related to our work.
